{{!-- Collapsible tab search: a round magnifying-glass button that expands into a
      filter box when clicked. Sits to the right of a tab's header text and filters
      that whole tab client-side (see wireTabSearch in StonetopCharacterSheet).
      Caller passes `title` (button tooltip / aria label) and `placeholder`.

      `stonetop-section-heading-control` marks it as a control that RIDES IN a heading rather
      than in the content below it, so folding the section takes it along — see
      _wireSectionCollapse. Without it, a search box would be left hovering over nothing. --}}
<span class="stonetop-tab-search stonetop-section-heading-control" role="search">
	<button type="button" class="stonetop-tab-search-toggle" title="{{title}}" aria-label="{{title}}">
		<i class="fas fa-magnifying-glass" aria-hidden="true"></i>
	</button>
	<input type="search" class="stonetop-tab-search-input" placeholder="{{placeholder}}" aria-label="{{title}}">
</span>
